      "worked": "Both comparisons must hold.\n$$\\begin{align*}-2x+4&\\le 2\\\\-2x&\\le -2\\\\x&\\ge 1\\end{align*}$$\nDividing by $-2$ reverses the inequality.\n$$\\begin{align*}2&\\le 3x-1\\\\3&\\le 3x\\\\x&\\ge 1\\end{align*}$$\nBoth give $x\\ge 1$, so their intersection is $x\\ge 1$.",
